{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-roleplay-about-ordering-at-a-sushi-restaurant-write-like-you-are-talking-to-explain-cle/audio/main-e28f2d853958.mp3","durationSec":116.04,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.74,"text":"At a sushi counter, Mira is the server."},{"start":3.36,"end":7.28,"text":"Her menu has salmon, tuna, shrimp, egg, and a cucumber roll."},{"start":8,"end":10.96,"text":"A customer wants lunch but has not chosen a dish."},{"start":11.62,"end":13.7,"text":"The customer first asks what is available."},{"start":14.52,"end":17.58,"text":"Mira says that every item on this menu is available today."},{"start":18.38,"end":20.52,"text":"The customer then asks about the cucumber roll."},{"start":21.1,"end":25.16,"text":"In this example, it has cucumber and rice inside seaweed, with no fish."},{"start":25.76,"end":27.98,"text":"That answer helps the customer choose food they want."},{"start":28.4,"end":31.48,"text":"The customer orders the roll instead of guessing from its name."},{"start":32.36,"end":36.8,"text":"A short question about a dish can make an order clear before the server starts preparing it."},{"start":37.34,"end":40,"text":"In another order, Ken is the sushi chef."},{"start":40.66,"end":44.84,"text":"His menu offers salmon, tuna, shrimp, and egg sushi by the piece."},{"start":45.66,"end":49.6,"text":"The cucumber roll comes as one whole roll, cut into smaller pieces."},{"start":50.26,"end":53.7,"text":"A customer asks for two pieces of salmon and one cucumber roll."},{"start":54.14,"end":55.82,"text":"Ken repeats both parts of the order."},{"start":55.82,"end":59.68,"text":"This matters because two pieces and two rolls are different amounts."},{"start":59.68,"end":62.64,"text":"The customer listens and confirms the order."},{"start":63.44,"end":65.72,"text":"Then the customer adds one piece of egg sushi."},{"start":65.72,"end":69.34,"text":"Ken repeats the complete order again before preparing it."},{"start":69.88,"end":75.36,"text":"Naming the food and the amount together helps both people understand exactly what the customer wants to eat."},{"start":76.84,"end":80.5,"text":"Back at Mira's counter, a customer has chosen shrimp sushi."},{"start":81.36,"end":85.06,"text":"This order comes with soy sauce, but no ginger or wasabi."},{"start":85.62,"end":88.62,"text":"The customer wants ginger and asks for it separately."},{"start":89.52,"end":91.82,"text":"Mira brings a small dish of ginger beside the sushi."},{"start":92.5,"end":95.66,"text":"The customer does not want wasabi, so Mira leaves it out."},{"start":95.66,"end":99.64,"text":"Tea is available in this situation, and the customer orders a cup."},{"start":100.88,"end":102.84,"text":"After eating, the customer asks for the bill."},{"start":103.52,"end":105.84,"text":"Mira brings a bill that lists the sushi and tea."},{"start":106.24,"end":109.06,"text":"The customer checks that both items match the order."},{"start":109.66,"end":115.7,"text":"In this example, card payment is accepted, and the customer pays by card before leaving."}],"words":[{"text":"At","start":0,"end":0.14},{"text":"a","start":0.14,"end":0.28},{"text":"fictional","start":0.28,"end":0.6},{"text":"sushi","start":0.6,"end":1.04},{"text":"counter","start":1.04,"end":1.46},{"text":"Mira","start":1.88,"end":2.06},{"text":"is","start":2.06,"end":2.26},{"text":"the","start":2.26,"end":2.42},{"text":"server","start":2.42,"end":2.74},{"text":"Her","start":3.36,"end":3.44},{"text":"menu","start":3.44,"end":3.7},{"text":"has","start":3.7,"end":3.94},{"text":"salmon","start":3.94,"end":4.28},{"text":"tuna","start":4.64,"end":4.96},{"text":"shrimp","start":5.28,"end":5.64},{"text":"egg","start":5.96,"end":6.22},{"text":"and","start":6.44,"end":6.48},{"text":"a","start":6.48,"end":6.62},{"text":"cucumber","start":6.62,"end":7.02},{"text":"roll","start":7.02,"end":7.28},{"text":"A","start":8,"end":8.12},{"text":"customer","start":8.12,"end":8.44},{"text":"wants","